  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "After killing Yao Ge Pi, Fang Yuan carries the corpse away, stalls the immortal aperture with wisdom path methods, returns through a stargate into Tai Bai Yun Sheng’s immortal aperture, then uses Fixed Immortal Travel toward the north-eastern extremity of Eastern Sea. He dives into the sea unseen and places Yao Ge Pi’s immortal aperture on the seabed; when it forms a blessed land, heaven qi and earth qi disturbance draws two whale desolate beasts that he chases off.",
      "chapters": [
        897
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "char_tai_bai_yun_sheng",
        "gu_fixed_immortal_travel",
        "reg_eastern_sea"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The land spirit is a tree planted at the center of the blessed land, with no movement ability.",
      "chapters": [
        897
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Entering under another appearance, Fang Yuan meets the land spirit: Yao Ge Pi was a wood path Gu Immortal, and the spirit is a tree planted at the center of Ge Pi blessed land with no movement ability. The ownership condition is a hundred thousand immortal essence stones, large amounts of immortal materials including many rank seven and rank eight materials, and the fresh blood of Genesis Lotus Immortal Venerable. Fang Yuan cannot meet it and leaves; he reads the demand as Yao Ge Pi’s wealth obsession rather than any condition tied to the killer, and plans a later forceful takeover instead of normal mastery. He scatters mortal Gu into a formation so Fixed Immortal Travel’s aura fades, leaving the seabed site hard to find without strong investigation methods.",
      "chapters": [
        897
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "tree-land-spirit-and-ownership-condition",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "char_genesis_lotus_immortal_venerable",
        "sys_mortal_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Among things he could do, he lists the claiming of Ge Pi blessed land beside raising hairy men, his eight sources of revenue, and the use of Gu Immortal souls.",
      "chapters": [
        916
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "claiming-among-plans",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "res_gu_immortal_soul"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "In a later Eastern Sea stretch he recalls that when he placed Star Form blessed land and Ge Pi blessed land, he used those placement chances to enter the lands.",
      "chapters": [
        1151
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
